WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,680
What I saw with my own eyes was that Cheng Guogong’s son beat Erya to death.

2
00:00:04,880 --> 00:00:06,680
That man is so arrogant

3
00:00:08,190 --> 00:00:09,990
Then did you see clearly what the murderer looked like?

4
00:00:09,990 --> 00:00:12,230
You can see clearly that he is the prodigal son.

5
00:00:15,050 --> 00:00:17,810
Then you must be the one killed by me.

6
00:00:19,960 --> 00:00:27,380
What happened to the prodigal son who you beat to death?

7
00:00:27,650 --> 00:00:30,050
Now that you have seen clearly, this is the person this young master killed.

8
00:00:30,450 --> 00:00:32,570
Then let me ask you what clothes he is wearing

9
00:00:32,930 --> 00:00:40,500
I remember it was the clothes he was wearing.

10
00:00:40,740 --> 00:00:47,380
Huzi, you don’t look like Fang Yang at all, do you?

11
00:00:48,070 --> 00:00:50,590
Maybe I saw it wrong because of my old eyesight.

12
00:00:51,740 --> 00:00:54,100
But I heard what they said

13
00:00:54,300 --> 00:00:56,700
The man said he wanted your little sister to be a concubine in the Duke's mansion.

14
00:00:56,860 --> 00:00:57,900
Your little sister disagrees

15
00:00:57,900 --> 00:00:59,940
He asked someone to beat your little sister to death
